WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.010
(Man shouts)

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.011
Stay down.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.012
♪♪

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:16.475
It's very interesting, a family
immigrating to Mexico rather
than in the other direction.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.185
It's a novel concept.

00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:21.271
If you do what he say, if you
cross the border you're gonna
die.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:22.856
You and your kids are gonna die.

00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:26.693
Neil Cross:
The more I like the characters
that I'm writing,

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:29.529
the more peril I want to expose
them to.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.407
Neil Cross:
You wanna see what any given
character is gonna do

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:33.784
Neil Cross:
in a given situation.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.035
You need to drink.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.746
♪♪

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.456
You're no good to the kids if
you're dead in the desert.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.874
♪♪

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.376
Justin Theroux:
This has been a really hard
shoot.

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:43.377
♪♪

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:46.672
There's one way of shooting a
show, which is on sound-stages
in Burbank.

00:00:46.672 --> 00:00:47.965
Justin Theroux:
You want it to look like the
desert you

00:00:47.965 --> 00:00:49.174
Justin Theroux:
drive a little bit out of LA.

00:00:49.508 --> 00:00:50.592
Justin Theroux:
This is wildly different.

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:53.845
Actually going to all these
different places and it's so
diverse.

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:55.222
Logan Polish:
It was just so exciting.

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:57.391
Justin Theroux:
We were kinda having the similar
experience

00:00:57.391 --> 00:00:58.725
Justin Theroux:
as the Foxes themselves.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:02.354
Which is it started in
California, shooting that, oh
that's lovely.

00:01:02.354 --> 00:01:04.982
Justin Theroux:
Then we went to this border-town
in Mexicali

00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:07.067
Justin Theroux:
to shoot some of the
desert episode.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:12.072
Justin Theroux:
It has this enormous scope and
this enormous canvas.

00:01:12.823 --> 00:01:16.827
You often have, often have
nightmares thinking about that
episode.

00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:21.581
Melissa George:
We had a fantastic director that
just put us through Hell

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.709
Melissa George:
because that's what they were
going through and that's

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:25.294
Melissa George:
what they decided they would do
to us.

00:01:25.294 --> 00:01:30.465
Melissa George:
So we would eat cactus fruit and
thirsty and sleeping in a bus.

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:32.426
♪♪
(Blowing on hands)

00:01:32.426 --> 00:01:33.427
Man:
Don't do that.

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:34.636
♪♪

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:35.637
Moisture makes it worse.

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:36.930
♪♪

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.141
They'd surround us in the
environment our characters are
in.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.768
Gabriel Bateman:
I definitely think it kinda
bonded us as a group,

00:01:41.977 --> 00:01:43.520
Gabriel Bateman:
and makes us seem more like
a family.

00:01:43.979 --> 00:01:46.106
And when you're sweating, you're
really sweating. Ya know?

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.399
Justin Theroux:
When you're cold, you're really
cold.

00:01:47.399 --> 00:01:49.109
Justin Theroux:
When you're hot, you're really
hot.

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.403
Justin Theroux:
Hopefully that translates in the
show itself.

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:58.410
♪♪

